                                "sense_id": "76d89350-c61e-3971-b193-d382b24ac415",
                                "text": "Or call him, if you will, an American Backwoodsman, who had to fell unpenetrated forests, and battle with innumerable wolves, and did not entirely forbear strong liquor, rioting, and even theft; whom, notwithstanding, the peaceful Sower will follow, and, as he cuts the boundless harvest, bless.\""
                            },
