                                "sense_id": "76d89350-c61e-3971-b193-d382b24ac415",
                                "text": "\"We asked him to explain more precisely the situation of this fountain, and he said: 'You are doubtless aware that perpetual darkness surrounds the pole unpenetrated by any ray of light till God permits."
